    "intro_html":  "Jollof rice has started friendly wars across West Africa over whose version is best, and one pot of it will explain why. Smoky tomato rice with seared chicken thighs delivers \u003cstrong\u003e50 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e per bowl for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.89\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
